Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.62,0:22:32.83,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}傷つくことを勲章に　Live your life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:38.41,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}So you want to be free　聞こえてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:45.91,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}立ち向かおう　向かい風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:49.84,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}強いくらい　ちょうどいい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:54.39,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}Change the world yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:58.26,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}BEAUTIFUL DREAMER
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:01.66,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}気づいて　Your dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:08.80,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}抱きしめた願いは　青空を目指す
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.98,0:23:12.52,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}BEAUTIFUL DREAMER
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:15.70,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}なくすものはない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:19.51,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}取り戻せ　自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:26.43,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}羽ばたくだけ　心のまま
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.63,0:23:35.09,ED-JP_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}生まれ変わる　You’re like a butterfly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.00,0:22:13.46,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}不斷重複的每一天
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.44,0:22:17.41,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}你甚至忘記了哭泣
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.02,0:22:24.14,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}只是懷著已經褪色的夢想
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.03,0:22:28.37,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}就算遍體鱗傷也沒關係
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.62,0:22:32.83,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}將傷痕當做勳章 做好你自己
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.83,0:22:38.41,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}所以你才想要自由 聽得到嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.04,0:22:45.91,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}迎著強勁的風
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.99,0:22:49.84,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}風越強就越合我意
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.84,0:22:54.39,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}改變世界吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.38,0:23:01.66,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}別忘記你的夢想
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.95,0:23:08.80,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}心中的願望 是飛向藍天
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.80,0:23:15.70,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}沒有什麼可失去
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.11,0:23:19.51,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}找回原本的自己吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.63,0:23:26.43,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}隨心所欲 振翅高飛吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.63,0:23:35.09,ED-CHT_EP04,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur4}化身成蝴蝶一般飛翔吧
